  "publicIdeasTitleAccent": "people first",
  "publicIdeasLede": "Quad is a complete school system. These are the things it does that others don’t, and the reasons schools tell us they switched.",
  "publicIdeasStoryKicker": "Story first",
  "publicIdeasStoryTitle": "Mornings start with a few plain sentences",
  "publicIdeasStoryBody": "Every home screen opens with what is happening and what needs you: who’s in, what’s due, what went well. The charts come after.",
  "publicIdeasStoryQuoteLabel": "The principal’s Monday",
  "publicIdeasStoryQuote": "Good morning, Prishan. 1,186 of 1,248 students are in. Three things need you today.",
  "publicIdeasWarningKicker": "Early warning",
  "publicIdeasWarningTitle": "Quad notices the child who’s drifting",
  "publicIdeasWarningBody": "When a student starts to slip in attendance, homework, behaviour or marks, Quad says why and suggests who is best placed to help. One click starts a support plan.",
  "publicIdeasWarningQuoteLabel": "Needs a conversation",
  "publicIdeasWarningQuote": "Kavindu: History down 14 points this term, two missed submissions. Suggested: Mr. Mendis, his class teacher.",
  "publicIdeasAskKicker": "Ask Quad",
  "publicIdeasAskTitle": "Ask in plain English, see where the answer came from",
  "publicIdeasAskBody": "Quad answers from your school’s own records, names its sources, and only uses what you’re allowed to see. It never reads safeguarding or medical notes.",
  "publicIdeasAskQuoteLabel": "Ms. Fernando asked",
  "publicIdeasAskQuote": "Who needs attention in Year 9?",
  "publicIdeasAskQuoteAnswer": "Four students. From: early warning, registers.",
  "publicIdeasBrandKicker": "Your school’s own brand",
  "publicIdeasBrandTitle": "One app for every family, wearing your colours",
  "publicIdeasBrandBody": "Families download one Quad app. Once they sign in it shows your school’s name, logo and colours, and says Year 4, Grade 4 or Form 1 the way you do.",
  "publicIdeasBrandQuoteLabel": "What parents see",
  "publicIdeasBrandQuote": "Their school, not a software company.",
